  "published": "2026-10-30T21:30:46.583Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.1 adds a native net9.0 target while retaining netstandard2.0 for existing consumers. No public API signatures have changed.\n\n- Performance: Layout metadata is cached by DTO type, and serialization writes directly to a StringBuilder, reducing repeated reflection and temporary string allocations.\n- Null collections: During ToConcatString(), a null collection marked with [FieldObjType] is treated as empty. A null single-object property still throws an exception to prevent subsequent fields from shifting.\n- Thread-safe metadata cache: The metadata cache supports concurrent access. DTO instances should not be modified while they are being serialized.\n\nSee the README on GitHub for benchmark details: https://github.com/agpcardoso/AGPC.FixedLayout#version-101--whats-new",
